    "body": "> I dont think showing the origin name is technically possible\r\n\r\nI think the OP is asking for the equivalent of `git describe --all`.\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ git status\r\nHEAD detached at d43c309\r\nnothing to commit, working tree clean\r\n\r\n$ git describe --all\r\nremotes/origin/HEAD\r\n```",
