    "body": "I'd like to see the first available of the following list. By no means this list is complete regarding the Git objects that could be displayed. I'm just saying what for me would be useful and a logical order.\r\n\r\n - `branch_name`\r\n - `tag_name`\r\n - `remote_name/branch_name`\r\n - otherwise default to the current commit's 7 char SHA",
