    "updated_at": "2020-02-17T17:56:09Z",
    "body": "SO I did a bit of digging on this since the old prompt that I used seemed to display this info and found that zsh has a function to pull this information within their `vcs_info` stdlib function\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/zsh-users/zsh/blob/459e2be810b7b01e79c832ee05d7ca7333c7c5fe/Functions/VCS_Info/Backends/VCS_INFO_get_data_git#L75-L123\r\n\r\nMy only issue is I don't know how to get `git name-rev` from `git2-rs` or if that functionality exists at all within `libgit2`",
