    "updated_at": "2025-04-29T03:33:10Z",
    "body": "No, I think it doesn't work.\nMy workaround:\n```toml\n[custom.git_branch]\nformat = \"[$output]($style)\"\nstyle = \"green\"\ncommand = \"git name-rev --no-undefined --exclude 'HEAD' --exclude '*/HEAD' --name-only HEAD\"\nwhen = true\n```",
